    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Section 0 is the load-bearing one",
      "items": [
        "Five hardcoded lists became one registry read",
        "A directory absent from it is not scanned: no error, no warning, an entire artifact class unenforced while the gate prints green",
        "That is the defect the registry exists to convert into a loud one"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Moving a list into data is not free",
      "items": [
        "Registry data needs a check, or it is less protected than the hardcoded list it replaced",
        "Every registry here has a schema and a check — except the one that pins compilers, which is recorded debt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Counts are printed, never asserted",
      "items": [
        "A hand-maintained number in a comment has been wrong three times",
        "The gate prints every count live, so the authoritative figure is one command away and never in prose"
      ]
